								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Security measures evaluation</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Data subject rights implementation review</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Detailed audit report with remediation plan</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Service 3 -->
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-body">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-3">
								Data Breach Response & Incident Management
							</h3>
							<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 mb-4">
								Prepare for and respond to data breaches with expert guidance, including NPC notification procedures and damage control strategies.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Breach response plan development</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>72-hour NPC notification compliance</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Data subject communication templates</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Post-incident review and improvement</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Service 4 -->
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-body">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-3">
								NPC Registration Assistance
							</h3>
							<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 mb-4">
								Navigate the National Privacy Commission registration process with expert assistance to ensure accurate and timely compliance.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Eligibility assessment for registration</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Registration form preparation and filing</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Annual renewal management</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Update notifications when required</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Service 5 -->
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-body">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-3">
								Employee Training & Awareness Programs
							</h3>
							<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 mb-4">
								Build a privacy-aware culture through comprehensive training programs for all levels of your organization.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>General data privacy awareness training</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Role-specific privacy training (HR, IT, Marketing)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Executive-level privacy briefings</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Annual refresher programs</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Service 6 -->
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-body">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-3">
								Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA)
							</h3>
							<p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 mb-4">
								Identify and mitigate privacy risks in new projects, systems, or processing activities before implementation.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-neutral-600">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>DPIA scoping and necessity assessment</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Risk identification and evaluation</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Mitigation measures recommendations</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600">•</span>
									<span>Documentation for NPC review</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Who Needs DPO Section -->
		<section class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					<h2 class="text-center mb-8">Does Your Business Need a Data Protection Officer?</h2>

					<div class="bg-accent-50 border-l-4 border-accent-500 p-6 rounded-lg mb-8">
						<p class="text-neutral-800 font-semibold mb-2">Under RA 10173, <strong>every</strong> organization that processes personal data needs a DPO &mdash; no threshold, no size exemption (IRR Section 26(a); NPC Advisory 2017-01).</p>
						<p class="text-neutral-700 mb-3">What the well-known figures actually decide is whether you must <strong>register your data processing systems</strong> with the NPC. Under Circular 2022-04 Section 5, you register if <strong>any one</strong> of these applies:</p>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-neutral-700">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"/>
								</svg>
								<span>You employ <strong>250 or more persons</strong></span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"/>
								</svg>
								<span>You hold <strong>sensitive personal information on 1,000 or more individuals</strong> &mdash; and note that under DPA Section 3(l), financial data and biometrics are <em>not</em> sensitive personal information; government-issued IDs are</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"/>
								</svg>
								<span>Your processing is <strong>likely to pose a risk to data subjects&rsquo; rights and freedoms</strong></span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"/>
								</svg>
								<span>You carry out <strong>automated decision-making or profiling</strong> &mdash; this one has no threshold at all</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
									<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"/>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>None of the four?</strong> You still designate a DPO, and you file a notarized sworn declaration with the NPC saying you meet none of them (Circular 2022-04, Annex 1). There is no do-nothing option.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-4">Industries We Serve</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-primary-600 font-bold">→</span>
									<span><strong>Healthcare & Medical:</strong> Hospitals, clinics, diagnostic centers</span>
